/T (Community health workers are an important link between local communities and healthcare services. Their day-to-day activities may include recording patient information, checking whether a follow-up is due, supporting vaccination schedules, noting medicine-related reminders, and visiting households. These activities require information to be available at the right time and in a form that is easy to understand while working outside a clinic or office.)
/E (Community health workers are an important link between local communities and healthcare services. Their day-to-day activities may include recording patient information, checking whether a follow-up is due, supporting vaccination schedules, noting medicine-related reminders, and visiting households. These activities require information to be available at the right time and in a form that is easy to understand while working outside a clinic or office.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
