61 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 42 0 R
/T (When information is stored in notebooks, paper files, or separate applications, workers may need to search across multiple sources to understand a patient's recent activity or next follow-up date. This creates additional work and can make it harder to maintain a consistent view of pending tasks. Network access is another practical concern: a mobile application that depends on a continuous internet connection may become difficult to use during field visits. CareConnect addresses these needs through a unified Android application. The project combines patient management with an offline-first approach, follow-up prioritization, reminders, mapping, reports, and general health-information access. Its design also considers English and Kannada language support and voice interaction, with the aim of making the application more accessible)
/E (When information is stored in notebooks, paper files, or separate applications, workers may need to search across multiple sources to understand a patient's recent activity or next follow-up date. This creates additional work and can make it harder to maintain a consistent view of pending tasks. Network access is another practical concern: a mobile application that depends on a continuous internet connection may become difficult to use during field visits. CareConnect addresses these needs through a unified Android application. The project combines patient management with an offline-first approach, follow-up prioritization, reminders, mapping, reports, and general health-information access. Its design also considers English and Kannada language support and voice interaction, with the aim of making the application more accessible)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [14]
>>
