/Title (CareConnect is a Community Health Worker Assistance Platform designed to organize patient information and routine follow-up activities through one Android application. Its feature set brings together patient registration and records, offline-first data handling, Firebase-based cloud services, priority follow-up, reminders, reports, field mapping, AI-assisted general health information, and English/Kannada language and voice-related support.)
