596 0 obj
<<
/Title (The problem addressed by CareConnect is the absence of a single, field-ready workflow that combines structured patient information with offline access and organized follow-up. The system is intended to reduce the need to switch between separate tools and to make key information easier to access during community visits. It supports workers' administrative and informational tasks; it is not designed to diagnose illness or prescribe treatment.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 583 0 R
/Prev 605 0 R
>>
