/Title (CareConnect is aligned conceptually with Sustainable Development Goal 3: Good Health and Well-being. Digital patient records can support more organized information management; reminders can help workers review scheduled preventive-care activities; priority lists can make pending follow-ups more visible; and general health- information access may help workers respond to common information needs. Offline-first design is relevant to field settings where network access is not always available. These are intended contributions of the design, not measured evidence of improved health outcomes.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 584 0 R
>>
